2. Retrieve all books published after 2010 sorted by author:
   SELECT Books.*, Authors.first_name, Authors.last_name FROM Books JOIN Authors ON Books.author_id = Authors.author_id WHERE Books.publication_date > '2010-01-01' ORDER BY Authors.last_name, Authors.first_name;

3. Retrieve all books in the "Science Fiction" genre:
   SELECT Books.*, Genres.name AS genre FROM Books JOIN Genres ON Books.genre_id = Genres.genre_id WHERE Genres.name = 'Science Fiction';

4. Retrieve the total number of books written by a specific author:
   SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Books WHERE author_id = [specific author ID];

5. Update the summary of a specific book:
   UPDATE Books SET summary = '[new summary]' WHERE book_id = [specific book ID];

6. Delete a specific book:
   DELETE FROM Books WHERE book_id = [specific book ID];

